01:30.827 --> 01:35.537
The Adored Elder Sister

01:42.957 --> 01:44.627
Elder Sister Hinata!

01:46.087 --> 01:47.667
I've been waiting for you!

01:47.917 --> 01:49.997
Let's play ninja!

01:52.377 --> 01:55.457
I'm sorry, Hanabi.
I can't right now.

01:55.547 --> 01:58.497
Huh? Come on,
just for a little while!

01:58.587 --> 02:00.247
That will not do, Lady Hanabi.

02:01.087 --> 02:04.247
Lady Hinata must train
with Lord Hiashi.

02:05.247 --> 02:07.247
I will play with you.

02:08.247 --> 02:09.997
Please be on your way.

02:10.087 --> 02:11.417
I'll see you later, Hanabi.

02:13.047 --> 02:16.377
No, no! Elder Sister!

02:22.797 --> 02:24.797
It's so boring...

02:24.877 --> 02:27.247
It can't be helped.

02:27.337 --> 02:30.837
Her ladyship is the successor
of the main family.

02:31.877 --> 02:34.127
But just a little can't hurt...

02:34.457 --> 02:37.547
We Hyuga are an illustrious clan
within the Hidden Leaf,

02:37.627 --> 02:41.797
who possess Byakugan, the most touted
of all the Kekkai Genkai.

02:41.997 --> 02:44.247
As the leader of the clan,

02:44.337 --> 02:47.747
there is a mountain of knowledge
that Lady Hinata must learn.

02:48.167 --> 02:49.667
Here you go.

03:07.127 --> 03:08.167
Lady Hanabi!

03:09.207 --> 03:10.667
Lady Hanabi!

03:12.707 --> 03:16.047
Now where did she run off to?

03:23.667 --> 03:25.957
I found Elder Sister!

03:43.457 --> 03:46.547
I didn't get to play
with Elder Sister today...

03:53.747 --> 03:54.997
Elder Sister Hinata!

03:55.957 --> 03:57.207
Sorry I'm late.

03:58.627 --> 03:59.707
No problem!

04:10.087 --> 04:10.797
Huh?

04:43.547 --> 04:46.377
Elder Sister came yesterday.

04:47.047 --> 04:49.377
She must have been exhausted
from all that training.

04:49.957 --> 04:51.877
Did you thank her properly?

04:53.997 --> 04:55.877
Well... She fell asleep,
so I'll tell her next time!

04:57.337 --> 04:59.167
Yes, please do that.

04:59.997 --> 05:02.047
What's the big idea?!

05:02.957 --> 05:06.167
What're you doing here,
you're a curse on all of us!

05:06.997 --> 05:09.297
What? I was only...

05:09.627 --> 05:11.707
I was only looking at the masks!

05:12.047 --> 05:13.207
You want this?

05:14.047 --> 05:15.917
You filthy loser?

05:16.457 --> 05:19.087
You disgust me.
Just take it!

05:23.087 --> 05:26.087
You can have it.
Now get lost!

05:29.797 --> 05:31.917
Hey Natsu, who is that boy?

05:33.087 --> 05:33.997
Well...

05:36.087 --> 05:38.667
It's as the shopkeeper said.

05:40.127 --> 05:41.627
What?!

05:42.297 --> 05:45.997
Why do you all look at me
with those eyes?

05:48.127 --> 05:51.497
You must never approach him.

06:00.957 --> 06:02.497
You're going to your studies?

06:02.707 --> 06:03.337
Yeah!

06:03.707 --> 06:05.707
I can write my name now.

06:05.797 --> 06:07.127
I even know some kanji!

06:07.707 --> 06:09.087
Actually lots!

06:09.747 --> 06:10.337
Really?

06:10.627 --> 06:13.457
Lady Hinata, you mustn't keep
Lord Hiashi waiting.

06:13.547 --> 06:14.127
Right.

06:15.587 --> 06:16.997
I'll see you later, Hanabi.

06:17.127 --> 06:17.797
Okay!

06:24.047 --> 06:25.707
Training, huh...

06:37.837 --> 06:39.087
Please focus.

06:40.087 --> 06:42.667
You can't go out to play
unless you finish.

06:49.087 --> 06:50.587
Done! Here!

06:56.497 --> 06:57.957
My, my...

07:14.547 --> 07:16.457
<i>So strong... yet so kind.</i>

07:16.797 --> 07:18.707
<i>I want to be like her...</i>

07:28.837 --> 07:32.087
<i>I want to be more like Elder Sister,</i>
<i>even just a little bit.</i>

07:41.667 --> 07:43.127
Elder Brother Neji?

07:43.377 --> 07:46.087
Her sparring partner
doesn't have to be me.

07:46.667 --> 07:48.337
Please let me do my own training.

07:48.957 --> 07:51.797
No, not yet. Continue.

07:52.297 --> 07:54.587
Please, let's continue, Neji.

07:58.917 --> 08:00.247
Understood.

08:08.957 --> 08:11.297
<i>That guy's different today...</i>

08:12.087 --> 08:14.087
What's wrong, Lady Hinata?

08:14.837 --> 08:16.377
This isn't child's play.

08:26.297 --> 08:28.047
<i>Hang in there, Elder Sister!</i>

08:30.707 --> 08:31.547
<i>That's so...</i>

08:33.047 --> 08:34.667
That was nothing...

08:36.047 --> 08:38.997
And you expect to fulfill
your destiny...

08:40.997 --> 08:42.837
As the leader of the Hyuga Clan?

09:02.837 --> 09:03.797
What?

09:04.247 --> 09:07.337
Ahhh... My head... My head...!

09:21.917 --> 09:23.087
The fool...

09:24.997 --> 09:25.917
<i>What's... going on?</i>

09:25.917 --> 09:27.417
<i>What was that?</i>

09:43.997 --> 09:45.417
<i>What was that?</i>

09:53.837 --> 09:56.047
You were peeking into
the training hall, weren't you?

09:59.457 --> 10:00.127
I see...

10:06.627 --> 10:11.047
That man was fine,
then suddenly, he was in agony...

10:11.997 --> 10:13.997
And the pattern on his forehead...

10:14.877 --> 10:17.917
What you saw was
the Curse Mark: Caged Bird...

10:17.997 --> 10:19.877
passed down within the Hyuga.

10:21.127 --> 10:23.087
The Curse Mark... Caged Bird?

10:24.087 --> 10:27.797
Yes. It reacts to the hidden seal
placed within the main family...

10:28.047 --> 10:29.627
If it is placed on you,

10:29.707 --> 10:31.957
they can easily destroy
your cranial nerves.

10:37.127 --> 10:39.087
So back then...

10:40.087 --> 10:43.167
When Neji threatened
Hinata with harm,

10:43.247 --> 10:46.587
Hiashi used the power of
the hidden seal to stop him.

10:47.087 --> 10:48.997
Why would he do such a thing?

10:54.587 --> 10:56.917
The main family of the Hyuga Clan
has the solemn duty

10:56.997 --> 11:00.047
of protecting the Byakugan
for eternity.

11:00.917 --> 11:02.997
For that, there are times
when we must rule over

11:03.087 --> 11:05.997
the side branch families
using absolute fear...

11:06.087 --> 11:08.837
in other words, "death,"
to keep them in line.

11:09.917 --> 11:12.707
Absolute fear...

11:14.547 --> 11:19.377
Naturally, some in the side
branch families oppose this.

11:20.207 --> 11:21.957
I speak of those
who harbor resentment

11:22.047 --> 11:23.167
towards the main family.

11:24.837 --> 11:26.087
But regardless of how much
we are hated,

11:26.167 --> 11:27.667
it is all for the sake
of the Hyuga Clan...

11:27.747 --> 11:28.917
that we possess this skill.

11:31.497 --> 11:33.627
So that's who we are...

11:33.837 --> 11:35.497
Listen well, Hanabi.

11:36.497 --> 11:41.547
All of us are born into this world
bearing our own destiny.

11:42.377 --> 11:45.797
In our lifetime,
that destiny never changes.

11:59.327 --> 12:00.997
How unusual...

12:01.537 --> 12:03.157
You're not in a rush today?

12:03.867 --> 12:05.997
Yeah... Not today...

12:19.707 --> 12:24.157
<i>I wonder if that guy is way stronger</i>
<i>than Elder Sister?</i>

12:42.997 --> 12:43.957
That's inadequate!

12:44.457 --> 12:46.207
Why did you hesitate right there?!

12:46.327 --> 12:48.037
Drive in, as hard as you can!

12:48.537 --> 12:49.077
Yes!

12:57.367 --> 12:58.957
Thank you very much.

13:10.207 --> 13:12.457
Is Hinata up to this?

13:15.957 --> 13:17.457
By her very nature,

13:17.537 --> 13:19.577
Hinata is not very good
at confrontation.

13:20.207 --> 13:22.077
Perhaps she is too kind.

13:22.787 --> 13:25.537
If that's the case,
she can't protect the Hyuga!

13:49.747 --> 13:51.787
<b>TRAINING GROUND 3</b>

13:59.157 --> 14:01.537
<i>What is she doing</i>
<i>in a place like this...?</i>

14:09.327 --> 14:10.907
Clone Jutsu!

14:20.497 --> 14:22.077
Clone Jutsu!

14:23.077 --> 14:24.657
<i>Wasn't he the one...?</i>

14:27.617 --> 14:30.497
<i>Why is Elder Sister watching him?</i>

14:32.117 --> 14:33.367
<i>Elder Sister?</i>

15:17.407 --> 15:18.367
I'm entering.

15:47.577 --> 15:50.957
They're supposed to
be five years apart in age.

15:51.287 --> 15:53.157
Lady Hanabi is quite amazing...

16:02.367 --> 16:04.657
How was training today?

16:06.327 --> 16:07.657
The same as usual...

16:08.407 --> 16:09.867
You seem depressed.

16:10.497 --> 16:12.707
You used to have
so much fun in the past...

16:14.957 --> 16:15.537
Yeah...

16:20.287 --> 16:22.157
I observed for a while...

16:22.327 --> 16:25.657
It's going to be difficult to let Hinata
succeed the main family.

16:26.787 --> 16:28.867
A decision must be made.

16:31.997 --> 16:32.997
I understand.

16:33.707 --> 16:36.457
However, I'd like to make
one request.

16:40.157 --> 16:43.037
You two will participate
in a mock battle today.

16:43.117 --> 16:43.707
Huh?

16:44.327 --> 16:46.537
I want to see all the skill and power
you've gained until now.

16:47.157 --> 16:49.787
Do not go easy on each other.

16:50.537 --> 16:52.367
Fight with the intent
to defeat each other!

16:53.997 --> 16:55.707
<i>Fight with the intent to defeat?</i>

16:55.787 --> 16:57.537
<i>What is Lord Hiashi thinking?</i>

17:00.867 --> 17:01.787
Hinata...

17:02.207 --> 17:04.327
You are the successor
of the Hyuga Clan.

17:04.577 --> 17:07.287
Show me that
you are worthy of that.

17:08.537 --> 17:09.327
Yes.

17:12.497 --> 17:15.367
<i>But I'm just supposed to fight...</i>

17:20.577 --> 17:21.537
Begin!

17:30.787 --> 17:32.497
<i>Elder Sister Hinata!</i>

17:37.287 --> 17:39.077
They're both amazing!

17:45.497 --> 17:46.827
<i>There's no end to this!</i>

17:48.117 --> 17:49.117
<i>Right there!</i>

17:51.657 --> 17:52.577
<i>Oh no!</i>

18:07.367 --> 18:08.407
Stop!

18:33.367 --> 18:34.537
Father...

18:34.867 --> 18:37.287
To fall to Hanabi who is five years
younger than you...

18:37.497 --> 18:39.327
Enough. You may go!

18:54.287 --> 18:57.537
Hinata will probably serve
the village as a genin.

18:59.997 --> 19:00.617
I see.

19:02.577 --> 19:03.707
As sad as it seems,

19:04.247 --> 19:07.247
we cannot allow a failure like
that to be our successor.

19:08.367 --> 19:10.077
This is her destiny.

19:12.997 --> 19:15.327
That you were born
possessing strength

19:15.407 --> 19:17.867
surpassing that of your elder sister
is also destiny.

19:18.747 --> 19:21.457
Hanabi, you must hone
your skills to the utmost

19:21.537 --> 19:24.247
for the sake of the Hyuga.

19:27.537 --> 19:28.497
Yes.

19:33.407 --> 19:39.157
<b>CLEAR MIND</b>

19:49.617 --> 19:51.537
Stand, Hanabi.

19:56.497 --> 19:59.037
Hinata will be under
my command from now.

19:59.707 --> 20:01.907
But are you sure about this?

20:05.037 --> 20:07.327
Hinata is the successor
of the Hyuga Clan.

20:08.247 --> 20:11.367
Genin missions carry
a high risk of death.

20:13.617 --> 20:15.247
Do what you will with her.

20:17.367 --> 20:20.367
She couldn't beat Hanabi
who is five years younger...

20:21.497 --> 20:23.327
The Hyuga have no need
for such a person.

20:26.827 --> 20:29.327
<i>Father has turned his back</i>
<i>on Elder Sister.</i>

20:31.537 --> 20:35.367
Is that all you wanted to discuss?
If so, you may go.

20:35.617 --> 20:36.907
We are busy here.

20:37.407 --> 20:38.327
All right.

20:43.707 --> 20:45.407
Continue, Hanabi.

20:46.537 --> 20:47.327
Yes.

20:51.407 --> 20:54.747
<i>If Elder Sister can't do it,</i>
<i>I have no choice but to do it.</i>

20:54.827 --> 20:56.657
<i>I will protect the Hyuga.</i>

20:57.707 --> 21:00.157
<i>This is my destiny!</i>

